{"actor":"model","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-41464","model_call":16,"attempt":1,"model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input_tokens":8691,"output_tokens":273,"total_tokens":8964,"cached_tokens":7936,"reasoning_tokens":89},"output_characters":882,"decision":{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_40_1103074658#4_2319986357","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of the Forbes article dedicated to reasons humility helps people get ahead; it directly says humility brings new perspectives, stronger relationships, happier customers, personal and professional growth, trust, confidence, loyalty, and magnifies other strengths.","learned":"Humility improves life by grounding people, opening them to resources and possibilities, strengthening trust and relationships, and supporting personal and professional growth."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"intellectual humility\" (+ wellbeing \"well-being\" flourishing happiness) (+ relationships growth))","reason":"Search a distinct evidence area: intellectual humility research, which may directly link humility with well-being, growth, relationships, and flourishing."}}}
