{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-41464","model_call":32,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3097"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q3097"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_740891692#20_1395841890","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3097","rank":4,"snippet":"self-control 4. Better work performance 5. Being more helpful 6. Earning people’s respect 7. Enabling freedom Be the first to get hottest news from our Editor-in-Chief You are already subscribed to our newsletter! \" , \"segment\": \"1. Soothing the soul Humble people are known to cope a little easier with anxiety about mortality. Instead of being afraid of death, humble and kind people are trying to find a useful perspective on life and live it better. Such an approach makes death easier to contemplate. Humility also gives peace of mind. It helps you to stay away from the <cover>stress and pressure of trying to become popular, powerful, and respected by others. Humility can also relieve you from attempts of being more significant. It can make you feel comfortable without lacking self-confidence. 2. Gaining excellence in leadership Humility is a key to excellent leadership.\" , \"start_char\": 8102.000000 , \"title\": \"Benefits of humility </cover>in life according to the Bible ▷ Legit.ng\" , \"url\": \"https://www.legit.ng/1216482-benefits-humility-life-according-bible.html\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_50_458419413#20_921425667","rank":3,"relevance":1}]},"time":9},"model_calls":32,"document_judgments":30,"relevance_3":11,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
